{%- comment -%} Health's pictures. The rings: Move outside, Exercise in the middle, Stand inside, each a thin circle (the goal) with a thick arc along it from the top (how far the day is), in black alone so that a black-and-white screen shows them as they are. The week: a bar a day, as tall as the day's steps against the best day's; the picture is stretched over the days' names (image--fill). {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture rings_svg -%}<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 120 120"><g fill="none" stroke="#000">{%- for r in rings -%}{%- assign rad = forloop.index0 | times: -14 | plus: 52 -%}<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="{{ rad }}" stroke-width="1.5"/>{%- if r.pct > 0 -%}<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="{{ rad }}" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="{{ rad | times: 6.2832 | times: r.pct | divided_by: 100.0 | round: 2 }} 400" transform="rotate(-90 60 60)"/>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}</g></svg>{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture rings_img -%}data:image/svg+xml;base64,{{ rings_svg | base64_encode }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- comment -%} In the inks of a colour screen: Move red, Exercise green, Stand blue. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ring_ink = "#f00,#0f0,#00f" | split: "," -%}
{%- capture rings_ink_svg -%}<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 120 120"><g fill="none">{%- for r in rings -%}{%- assign rad = forloop.index0 | times: -14 | plus: 52 -%}<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="{{ rad }}" stroke="{{ ring_ink[forloop.index0] }}" stroke-width="1.5"/>{%- if r.pct > 0 -%}<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="{{ rad }}" stroke="{{ ring_ink[forloop.index0] }}" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="{{ rad | times: 6.2832 | times: r.pct | divided_by: 100.0 | round: 2 }} 400" transform="rotate(-90 60 60)"/>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}</g></svg>{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture rings_ink -%}data:image/svg+xml;base64,{{ rings_ink_svg | base64_encode }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture week_svg -%}<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 70 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">{%- for w in week -%}<rect x="{{ forloop.index0 | times: 10 | plus: 1.5 }}" y="{{ 100 | minus: w.pct }}" width="7" height="{{ w.pct }}"/>{%- endfor -%}</svg>{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture week_img -%}data:image/svg+xml;base64,{{ week_svg | base64_encode }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture week_ink -%}data:image/svg+xml;base64,{{ week_svg | replace: '<rect ', '<rect fill="#00f" ' | base64_encode }}{%- endcapture -%}
